    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "ella",
        "speaker": "Ella",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 168,
        "text": "The community room needs some maintenance before the book event on Saturday. I have made a short list, but I do not want anyone to start work without the manager.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "70e1b08e48567854ae6d0dcebca3ab61605880a115c5368d7038b42b86d8519e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "jon",
        "speaker": "Jon",
        "sourceStart": 174,
        "sourceEnd": 206,
        "text": "Good. What did you notice first?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "f13b4a790b766af66e0ec10932d272ba94c5629ab74fcc995ec0a06d0f6777e8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ella",
        "speaker": "Ella",
        "sourceStart": 213,
        "sourceEnd": 354,
        "text": "The kitchen faucet drips, and the drain below the sink is slow. A pipe was checked last month, but the floor is still damp near the cupboard.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "bf6ad0e1339c116b899c92d0c03bedb16bc46bc3190e30cd78a55aca91f5f55d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "jon",
        "speaker": "Jon",
        "sourceStart": 360,
        "sourceEnd": 514,
        "text": "My uncle calls a faucet a tap. I will ask the office to send a qualified worker to inspect both the faucet and the drain. What time can someone meet them?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "80295f3ed3e7994b57fca9a781252590f37d361cbd9656450a0c6a10d5ccbfce",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ella",
        "speaker": "Ella",
        "sourceStart": 521,
        "sourceEnd": 691,
        "text": "The manager can meet the worker between two and three on Thursday. I will take a photo of the damp area for the report. The carpet is dry, so we can leave it where it is.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c144ed79a4f7e05e06858c234b9dab790e04d1c2de7c74430c2bcf115692eea8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "jon",
        "speaker": "Jon",
        "sourceStart": 697,
        "sourceEnd": 854,
        "text": "There is also a crack near the roof window. It was noticed on Tuesday, and the office has already contacted a specialist. The curtain was moved away from it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "2c986ca7a9117f6f62472af9eeb05d9562c94cc5a5c573de4b7f9837ba1e32e8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ella",
        "speaker": "Ella",
        "sourceStart": 861,
        "sourceEnd": 1038,
        "text": "The cupboard handle is loose too. A carpenter will decide whether to tighten the screw or replace the hinge. I found an old bolt in the drawer, but we should not assume it fits.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "5fa50c2d1696ecfa661b665d086e878e7c96a23b9538f894b7b503d67e1b4842",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "jon",
        "speaker": "Jon",
        "sourceStart": 1044,
        "sourceEnd": 1212,
        "text": "The carpenter brought a hammer, a nail and a drill to mend a wooden frame last time. This job may need different equipment. We will let the worker choose how to fix it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "44c6ea956e392d7c29a5dec8df9520662265375569fc8671ca3ebaaffac56e73",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ella",
        "speaker": "Ella",
        "sourceStart": 1219,
        "sourceEnd": 1375,
        "text": "What about the light? The bulb was replaced in March, but it is not working today. There is a cable near the socket, and I can see a wire beside the switch.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "43de23b8af2ebcab3e30be1d1ab1454665f673ff0f6f5e9d9991439c49f9fb10",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "jon",
        "speaker": "Jon",
        "sourceStart": 1381,
        "sourceEnd": 1532,
        "text": "Please leave those alone. The office will ask a qualified technician to check them. The lock was checked yesterday, and the two keys are in the office.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "81b31301ef89e64416e8f87a3470b4cddf2172038bd39cbbfb0e3574a0725430",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ella",
        "speaker": "Ella",
        "sourceStart": 1539,
        "sourceEnd": 1684,
        "text": "I will send the list now. The carpenter plans to come on Friday. If the old fitting is difficult to loosen, the worker can explain the next step.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "eff4a4403f4fe14e58dfebe3fab5112920919d1bc9ef59918a379db86ded9cd2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "jon",
        "speaker": "Jon",
        "sourceStart": 1690,
        "sourceEnd": 1751,
        "text": "Thanks. The building manager will decide what work is needed.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "ddec939de78587fe07f416088055ea4db6721021e9a3eb0b7e4129b18afaa905",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
